66-wangjinghong:line012","quote":"敬弘少有清尚，起家本國左常侍，衛軍參軍。性恬靜，樂山水。為天門太守。敬弘妻，桓玄姊也。敬弘之郡，玄時為荊州，遣信要令過。敬弘至巴陵，謂人曰：「靈寶見要，正當欲與其姊集聚耳，我不能為桓氏贅壻。」乃遣別船送妻往江陵。妻在桓氏，彌年不迎。山郡無事，恣其遊適，累日不回，意甚好之。轉桓偉安西長史、南平太守。去官，居作唐縣界。玄輔政及篡位，屢召不下。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-066-wangjinghong:line012:m0036","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-066-wangjinghong:line012:m0038"}]}],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p002","text":"伯子少好學，博覽經傳，而通率好為雜戲，遨遊閭里，故以此失清塗。解褐為駙馬都尉，奉朝請，員外散騎侍郎。著作郎徐廣重其才學，舉伯子及王韶之並為佐郎，助撰晉史及著桓玄等傳。遷尚書祠部郎。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"伯子","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BABAAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p002:m0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"徐廣","kind":"person","person_id":"qf8_544_pvp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p002:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"伯子","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BABAAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p002:m0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"王韶之","kind":"person","person_id":"yfa_tz5_3ge","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi:p002:m0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"桓玄","kind":"person","person_id":"lf6_f95_379","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":93,"last_line":94,"revision_id":1996694,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-060-xunbozi","book_id":"b-songshu-060","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-060-xunbozi"},{"id":"c-songshu-066-wangjinghong:line012","text":"敬弘少有清尚，起家本國左常侍，衛軍參軍。性恬靜，樂山水。為天門太守。敬弘妻，桓玄姊也。敬弘之郡，玄時為荊州，遣信要令過。敬弘至巴陵，謂人曰：「靈寶見要，正當欲與其姊集聚耳，我不能為桓氏贅壻。」乃遣別船送妻往江陵。妻在桓氏，彌年不迎。山郡無事，恣其遊適，累日不回，意甚好之。轉桓偉安西長史、南平太守。去官，居作唐縣界。玄輔政及篡位，屢召不下。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-066-wangjinghong:line012:m0000","start":0